    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n58254" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κόαλοι:</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βάρβαροι</span>, <i><span class="en">
			Hsch.
		</span></i>
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κοάξ</span></b> , onomatop., to express the
		croaking of frogs, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βρεκεκεκὲξ κοὰξ κοάξ</span>”
