					Ar.
					<u>Ra.</u>
					209
				</span></i>
			, al. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κόαρον:</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐλάχιστον</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κοάω</span></b> , 
				v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κοέω</span>
			. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κοβάθια</span></b> , 
				v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κωβάθια</span>
			. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κόβαθος</span></b> , sine expl.,
				<i><span class="en">
				<u>PLond.</u>
				1821.362
			</span></i> (in a list of cups). <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κόβακτρα:</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κολακεύματα, πανουργήματα</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i></div>
